 mas-story-28-nov-2026\n\nBrian Copeland performs his family-friendly show
 \, The Jewelry Box... A Genuine Christmas Story\, at The Marsh San Franci
 sco. In 1970s East Oakland\, six-year-old Brian tries to raise $11.97 to 
